[node name="Manual" parent="Interactables" unique_id=388296552 instance=ExtResource("4_dpqlu")]
position = Vector2(-602, 2591)
title = "Breaker Manual"
body = "BREAKER RESTART PROCEDURE

The emergency breakers must be switched on in this exact order:

        2   →   1   →   3   →   4

Once the first breaker is on you have 15 seconds to finish the sequence. If you take too long, or use the wrong order, the system trips and every breaker resets.

Each breaker is locked and needs its own key."
display_name = "Manual"

